    "message": "Due to critical issues with generation of shared resources (and after many attempts to fix it) I've decided to deprecate this for now, with a ticket open to microsoft via: https://github.com/microsoft/microsoft-ui-xaml/issues/10794 - will get this going again after an official response. To use, you would have to directly embed AJut.UX.WinUI3 in your solution which might cause licensing or other issues which I take no liability for as the MIT license states. Sorry this is unfortunate, and hopefully it's easy to fix soon.",
    "reasons": [
      "CriticalBugs"
    ]
  },
